    "intent": "Re-measure the orientation, shape, and translation cells under the corrected orientation sign anchor (net displacement instead of the centered first-stage row). Identical generator, evaluation, replicate count, effect sizes, base seed, and matched-seed policy as the Phase 4 medium pilot, so the comparison is like-for-like.",
